# Every text file in this repo is LF, in the index and in the working tree:
# pages, scripts, JSON, YAML.
#
# `eol=lf` overrides `core.autocrlf=true` on a Windows host, which on its own
# checks every text file out as CRLF. `text=auto` leaves the binary call to
# git, so the images under `.gitbook/assets/` are never touched.
*       text=auto eol=lf
